    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/116f80f3580cf2bdff1ce7a10a999f69.poster.avif?t=1748968546\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/116f80f3580cf2bdff1ce7a10a999f69.webm?t=1748968546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/116f80f3580cf2bdff1ce7a10a999f69.mp4?t=1748968546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depopulation Agent</strong> is an action-packed, arcade style, active shooter simulation with sandbox elements. Play as a lone terrorist with the sole mission of reducing the human population by <i>any means necessary</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/c2db05bd8d989a9a7246a5f7e5797d99.poster.avif?t=1748968546\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/c2db05bd8d989a9a7246a5f7e5797d99.webm?t=1748968546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate humans to earn points, to unlock new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced combat with law enforcement and anti-terror personnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take cash from slain civilians to buy weapons and gear from the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom loadouts to carry out your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with escalating degrees of difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/116f80f3580cf2bdff1ce7a10a999f69.poster.avif?t=1748968546\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/116f80f3580cf2bdff1ce7a10a999f69.webm?t=1748968546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/116f80f3580cf2bdff1ce7a10a999f69.mp4?t=1748968546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depopulation Agent</strong> is an action-packed, arcade style, active shooter simulation with sandbox elements. Play as a lone terrorist with the sole mission of reducing the human population by <i>any means necessary</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/c2db05bd8d989a9a7246a5f7e5797d99.poster.avif?t=1748968546\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547730/extras/c2db05bd8d989a9a7246a5f7e5797d99.webm?t=1748968546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate humans to earn points, to unlock new weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced combat with law enforcement and anti-terror personnel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take cash from slain civilians to buy weapons and gear from the black market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom loadouts to carry out your missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with escalating degrees of difficulty.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
